  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project support to Wilton Park 2022</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektst&#xf6;d till Wilton Park 2022</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribution to conference conducted by Wilton Park together with Sweden, WHO and Alliance of Health Systems Research. for Project Healthy Societies. The theme of the conference is how to make societies and institutions collaborate with actors in the health field and give citizens the opportunity to make healthier choices. The grant finance activities that benefit developing countries and contribute to social sustainable development. The project support will also finance participants in the conference from low- and middle-income countries.</narrative>
